***conformance tests***

# error-classes-are-exceptions
Each of `PlainSyntaxError`, `UnsupportedBase64Content`, `UnsupportedResourceType`, `InvalidFridArgument`, `InvalidLiquidVariableName`, `ModuleDoesNotExistError`, `MissingFunctionalitiesError`, `ImportedModuleWithFunctionalitiesError` and `MissingTestPlainFileError` in :ErrorClasses: is a subclass of the base exception class.

***acceptance tests***
